# Keep the Docker build context small and free of secrets: dependencies are
# installed fresh inside the image, and real settings come from deploy/.env
# at build/run time, never from files copied out of a developer's checkout.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.medusa
**/.turbo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.template
apps/backend/static
apps/backend/private
deploy
docs
*.dump
*.zip
